What more is there to be said?


00:18:36.648 --> 00:18:37.715
Jeez...


00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:41.590
This is disgusting.


00:18:46.392 --> 00:18:48.292
Jesus, that was heavier
than I thought.


00:18:48.294 --> 00:18:50.328
- Yeah.
- Dead bodies always are.


00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:53.165
Hey, Babe?
Can you grab my carry-on?


00:18:54.067 --> 00:18:56.403
I'm not gonna wander around the
desert dressed like this.


00:18:58.705 --> 00:19:01.006
Probably have something for you,
if you want.


00:19:01.708 --> 00:19:03.574
I like what I'm wearing.


00:19:03.576 --> 00:19:05.076
What about your heels?


00:19:05.078 --> 00:19:07.348
I like how they make my legs look.


00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:12.416
Hallelujah to that.


00:19:27.599 --> 00:19:29.999
There's gotta be a map in
here somewhere.


00:19:39.212 --> 00:19:41.413
Like it's not hot enough
out here already.


00:19:42.415 --> 00:19:43.815
Find anything?


00:19:44.517 --> 00:19:46.584
Ah, no. No. Not yet.


00:19:57.563 --> 00:19:59.430
I'd kill for an aspirin right now.


00:19:59.532 --> 00:20:01.532
Well how about one of these?


00:20:01.734 --> 00:20:03.868
Ohh, Vicodin.


00:20:04.693 --> 00:20:05.669
Where did you get those?


00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:08.474
Underneath the seat
where your hubby was sitting.


00:20:09.776 --> 00:20:13.111
Where the hell would I get
something like that from?


00:20:13.713 --> 00:20:14.679
Relax.


00:20:14.681 --> 00:20:19.417
I'm pulling your leg, man.
We can all thank Lizzy.


00:20:19.519 --> 00:20:24.389
Yeah. Lizzy. My assistant.
She borrowed the car.


00:20:24.891 --> 00:20:27.658
That woman has a brutal memory
but a great ass.


00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:28.793
Hey.


00:20:29.295 --> 00:20:31.195
Look, that was a long time
ago, Babe.


00:20:31.197 --> 00:20:32.197
All right, down the hatch.


00:20:32.298 --> 00:20:35.036
That's okay.
We all have a past.


00:20:38.538 --> 00:20:39.286
Wanna play?


00:20:48.481 --> 00:20:52.183
They're just painkillers.
We've got a long way ahead of us.


00:20:52.485 --> 00:20:53.787
Let's go.


00:20:56.789 --> 00:20:58.089
Saddle up!


00:20:58.891 --> 00:21:00.991
I can't believe you've
been holding this whole time.


00:21:00.993 --> 00:21:02.326
Yeah, now we be sharing.


00:21:02.328 --> 00:21:03.929
I'm sorry I doubted you.


00:21:04.931 --> 00:21:07.202
Forget it. Come on.


00:21:11.504 --> 00:21:13.571
BILLY Come on, slow pokes.


00:21:47.639 --> 00:21:48.739
Whooo!


00:21:52.578 --> 00:21:56.017
Roy, come on, man.
That is some good shit.


00:21:59.419 --> 00:22:00.367
Oh fuck it.


00:22:07.593 --> 00:22:11.397
We just survived a car crash, saw a
woman die right in front of us, and...


00:22:13.199 --> 00:22:15.165
we're stuck in the middle
of the fucking desert.


00:22:15.167 --> 00:22:16.601
Why don't you cut me some slack?


00:22:16.703 --> 00:22:17.968
I know, but after everything...


00:22:17.970 --> 00:22:18.737
I can handle it.


00:22:19.439 --> 00:22:20.971
All right, Jamie.
Have a hit.


00:22:20.973 --> 00:22:22.673
Don't push your luck, Billy.


00:22:22.775 --> 00:22:28.446
You know, it might be in all our best
interests if we just try to remain mellow.


00:22:28.448 --> 00:22:29.413
Is that so?


00:22:29.615 --> 00:22:30.815
It's a proven fact.


00:22:30.817 --> 00:22:33.918
People do crazy shit in the desert.


00:22:34.320 --> 00:22:37.888
Taking in all this vast expanse,
you mix in it with


00:22:37.890 --> 00:22:40.724
some sun stroke, and voila la!


00:22:40.726 --> 00:22:43.394
You got yourself a
bad batch of juju.


00:22:43.696 --> 00:22:46.797
Yeah, we get scripts sent to us
all the time about this shit.


00:22:46.799 --> 00:22:48.233
You mean movies?


00:22:49.035 --> 00:22:53.605
Like I could turn psycho
and drink all your blood?


00:22:54.707 --> 00:22:59.975
- Ahhh... Jesus... vampire!
- Get off... Ahhh!


00:23:03.682 --> 00:23:06.684
You know, I guess we should be
happy we're still alive.


00:23:07.086 --> 00:23:09.454
Yeah, we should.


00:23:09.756 --> 00:23:11.022
And you know what...?


00:23:12.024 --> 00:23:14.695
The highway's gonna show up
before we even know it.


00:23:18.097 --> 00:23:20.433
Then why don't you
give me a ride.


00:23:22.635 --> 00:23:24.402
Go get them. Haha!


00:23:28.840 --> 00:23:30.608
Whooo!


00:23:55.066 --> 00:23:57.566
I didn't spill my drink.


00:24:04.977 --> 00:24:07.044
I say we just keep walking to Vegas.


00:24:07.046 --> 00:24:09.614
Well aren't you awful
horny to get there.


00:24:10.116 --> 00:24:11.717
Fuck, yeah, aren't you?


00:24:12.819 --> 00:24:17.288
Tell you the truth, baby, everything
to me is a little hazy right now.


00:24:17.390 --> 00:24:20.292
Hey, you did propose.


00:24:21.894 --> 00:24:26.597
I witnessed it.
You're a hell of a romantic, Billy.


00:24:26.699 --> 00:24:30.370
Come on. Can't a guy get a
fucking break around here.


00:24:32.672 --> 00:24:35.373
Come on, I'm joking. Ok?


00:24:35.675 --> 00:24:37.374
Who wouldn't want to marry this face...


00:24:37.376 --> 00:24:40.976
and those gorgeous,
wrap-around legs.


00:24:46.986 --> 00:24:52.257
Let's go to Vegas! I promise,
you will not regret it.


00:24:52.859 --> 00:24:54.729
You are killing me, woman.


00:24:58.631 --> 00:25:00.633
I know what the blue ones are for.


00:25:02.635 --> 00:25:03.869
I just don't need them.


00:25:05.571 --> 00:25:06.604
Whooo!


00:25:06.606 --> 00:25:08.706
Vegas! Whooo!


00:25:11.844 --> 00:25:13.244
Gimme that ass!


00:25:14.046 --> 00:25:16.113
Hahaha!


00:25:21.086 --> 00:25:22.553
Come on! Let's go!


00:25:22.555 --> 00:25:24.622
Come on, slow pokes!


00:25:32.464 --> 00:25:34.433
Shouldn't we see something by now?


00:25:35.635 --> 00:25:36.768
We will.


00:25:37.970 --> 00:25:39.206
What is it?


00:25:42.108 --> 00:25:43.575
Just, ah...


00:25:44.577 --> 00:25:45.809
I'm just...


00:25:45.811 --> 00:25:47.579
Fuck, I'm hot!


00:25:48.581 --> 00:25:51.782
That's not nothing.
You're cut. Deep.


00:25:51.884 --> 00:25:54.785
Broken bottle of tequila.
Doesn't matter.


00:25:54.987 --> 00:25:58.656
Holy Fuck. You look like
one of them freaks from Oz.


00:25:58.658 --> 00:26:01.492
You know Billy, he's hurt.
Just leave him alone.


00:26:01.694 --> 00:26:03.661
Let me take a look.


00:26:03.663 --> 00:26:05.596
I'm fine.


00:26:05.598 --> 00:26:06.697
Look, Billy...


00:26:06.699 --> 00:26:10.535
I've done my time.
And it's done. Ok?


00:26:11.737 --> 00:26:12.738
It's done.


00:26:14.040 --> 00:26:15.973
- Babe, come on.
- You need to rest.


00:26:15.975 --> 00:26:18.041
Yeah, come on, bro.
Look, you're bleeding like hell.


00:26:18.043 --> 00:26:21.713
- Look. I'm fine. Ok?
- You see this?


00:26:22.515 --> 00:26:23.847
That will take care of it.


00:26:23.849 --> 00:26:26.717
All right.
We just need to keep moving.


00:26:26.719 --> 00:26:27.885
You can't keep taking those.


00:26:27.887 --> 00:26:29.486
Let him take two if it'll help.


00:26:29.488 --> 00:26:30.454
It's not your business.


00:26:30.456 --> 00:26:34.426
Enough! Ok? We're moving.


00:26:35.828 --> 00:26:37.096
Now!


00:26:39.298 --> 00:26:40.142
Come on!


00:26:47.773 --> 00:26:49.740
What do you think he did?


00:26:49.742 --> 00:26:51.747
Hopefully not his cell-mate.


00:26:57.249 --> 00:26:59.550
It's gotta be five miles by now.


00:26:59.552 --> 00:27:01.819
Ah, man. I'd kill for a mojito.


00:27:02.221 --> 00:27:03.922
And a cheeseburger.


00:27:05.224 --> 00:27:07.225
Where the hell is this road?


00:27:07.727 --> 00:27:10.595
Baby, you could get drunk
off my sweat right now.


00:27:11.297 --> 00:27:12.697
You wanna stop?


00:27:13.299 --> 00:27:15.033
Only if you do.


00:27:15.735 --> 00:27:17.234
Yeah, I can stop.


00:27:17.236 --> 00:27:20.941
Ah, Hey! Guys. Annie needs
to take a break.


00:27:24.043 --> 00:27:25.943
What is that?


00:27:25.945 --> 00:27:28.412
Not what. Who?


00:27:50.301 --> 00:27:52.340
What the fuck?


00:27:56.142 --> 00:27:58.108
No shit.


00:27:58.110 --> 00:27:59.781
What do you think happened?


00:28:03.983 --> 00:28:04.915
Be careful.


00:28:04.917 --> 00:28:06.285
Because why?


00:28:08.087 --> 00:28:10.154
No ID's.


00:28:10.156 --> 00:28:11.722
He looks like a gangster.


00:28:11.724 --> 00:28:12.856
Or a Fed.


00:28:12.858 --> 00:28:14.658
Looks like someone left in a hurry.


00:28:14.860 --> 00:28:16.794
Yeah... wouldn't you?


00:28:16.796 --> 00:28:20.264
Ok, guys.
This is too fucked up.


00:28:20.366 --> 00:28:22.300
This is just too fucked up.


00:28:23.202 --> 00:28:26.036
You think he has something to do
with the dead woman in your trunk?


00:28:26.238 --> 00:28:28.405
Oh, yeah, what,
she's a murderer too?


00:28:28.407 --> 00:28:30.240
No, no, no...


00:28:30.242 --> 00:28:34.244
Tyre tracks go the other way.
Long way for her to go.


00:28:34.246 --> 00:28:36.647
Gut-shot and naked in the cold night.


00:28:36.949 --> 00:28:39.016
Looks like someone came a
long way for something.


00:28:39.018 --> 00:28:40.618
Or someone.


00:28:40.720 --> 00:28:42.520
Oh, great.


00:28:42.922 --> 00:28:45.055
So in this entire hell of a place,


00:28:45.057 --> 00:28:48.178
we look for one person to help us
and we keep finding the dead ones.


00:28:49.227 --> 00:28:52.298
And today of all days.


00:28:54.200 --> 00:28:56.133
Do you think we should do
something with the body?


00:28:56.135 --> 00:28:58.502
No, no, no. Fuck him.


00:28:58.804 --> 00:29:01.572
I say we forget we even saw him.


00:29:01.674 --> 00:29:03.655
We have enough
problems of our own.


00:29:05.677 --> 00:29:09.513
Look, you think that maybe we
can stop for a rest now, Roy?


00:29:09.515 --> 00:29:11.115
No, no, no.
We should keep walking.


00:29:11.817 --> 00:29:16.220
The woman needs to take a break,
for Christ's sake.


00:29:16.822 --> 00:29:18.490
Look, give me the bag.


00:29:19.892 --> 00:29:23.563
- You fucking kidding?
- Here's your damn bag.


00:29:26.065 --> 00:29:27.132
Fucker.


00:29:28.834 --> 00:29:31.903
Annie, come on.
Let's get the fuck out of here.


00:29:32.805 --> 00:29:35.473
You know I think you might
need a rest too.


00:29:36.275 --> 00:29:38.676
They're crashing.
It'll be hard to get them...


00:29:38.677 --> 00:29:42.377
Then you should care about whoever
made those tyre tracks coming back.


00:29:52.391 --> 00:29:53.558
Come on.


00:30:13.411 --> 00:30:15.479
- Whoa, whoa, wait.
- I need to stop.


00:30:19.083 --> 00:30:20.718
We should never have come.


00:30:21.320 --> 00:30:23.555
Nobody was coming
along that road.


00:30:25.057 --> 00:30:26.658
I mean the whole trip.


00:30:28.360 --> 00:30:30.196
Yeah, it was your idea.


00:30:32.198 --> 00:30:34.631
I'm not saying it wasn't.
I'm saying we shouldn't have.


00:30:34.633 --> 00:30:36.803
Yeah, well we did,
so that's that.


00:30:39.805 --> 00:30:41.039
Hey.


00:30:42.041 --> 00:30:43.574
You wanna partake?


00:30:44.176 --> 00:30:45.643
Yeah.


00:30:52.917 --> 00:30:53.820
What?


00:30:56.422 --> 00:30:57.521
I didn't say a word.


00:30:57.523 --> 00:30:59.357
Your face said enough.


00:31:00.359 --> 00:31:02.159
What do you want from me, Roy?


00:31:02.561 --> 00:31:05.564
I know what you're thinking.


00:31:06.966 --> 00:31:10.068
Trust me. You have no idea.


00:31:11.170 --> 00:31:14.738
I'm tired, I'm hot, and I'm
fucking sore.


00:31:14.740 --> 00:31:15.840
Is that what you wanna hear?


00:31:16.942 --> 00:31:18.742
Huh? Is it?


00:31:18.944 --> 00:31:22.312
Come on, guys. Billy's right.
Let's just stay cool.


00:31:22.514 --> 00:31:27.318
No, you know what.
You especially should hear this.


00:31:28.420 --> 00:31:30.153
People aren't always as they appear.


00:31:30.155 --> 00:31:31.521
Girl like you should learn that.


00:31:31.523 --> 00:31:32.522
Here it comes.


00:31:32.524 --> 00:31:35.392
Think that tough guy act
gets me hot?


00:31:35.394 --> 00:31:37.327
Isn't that why you wrote me
in the first place?


00:31:37.329 --> 00:31:39.296
I wrote you because of my church.


00:31:39.298 --> 00:31:41.164
- Oh please.
- You got off on it.


00:31:41.166 --> 00:31:44.503
Yeah, because writing to
degenerates is so sexy.


00:31:46.105 --> 00:31:49.007
So I'm a degenerate now? Huh?


00:31:50.309 --> 00:31:52.576
Whoa! Ok...


00:31:56.614 --> 00:32:02.482
This is all very..
very entertaining but...


00:32:02.887 --> 00:32:04.622
what the hell are you guys
talking about?


00:32:04.924 --> 00:32:09.060
That's right, you don't know
how we actually met, do you?


00:32:09.862 --> 00:32:15.032
Let me tell you. Jamie here was
slumming it, getting her jollies


00:32:15.134 --> 00:32:19.637
writing to cons, trying
to save a few souls.


00:32:20.139 --> 00:32:23.741
No way. Haha!


00:32:24.543 --> 00:32:26.109
It wasn't like that.


00:32:26.111 --> 00:32:27.977
I was just some punk ass
drug dealer


00:32:27.979 --> 00:32:29.546
you could take home like a stray.


00:32:29.548 --> 00:32:31.281
You made me believe you
wanted to change.


00:32:31.383 --> 00:32:34.752
Don't kid yourself!
You believe what you want to!


00:32:34.954 --> 00:32:36.957
Billy, did you know any of this?


00:32:39.959 --> 00:32:40.759
Look...


00:32:42.361 --> 00:32:45.195
Lizzy didn't sell me these, ok...


00:32:45.397 --> 00:32:46.665
Roy did.


00:32:48.367 --> 00:32:49.934
No shit?


00:32:50.936 --> 00:32:52.837
Sorry, bro. Jig was up.


00:32:53.439 --> 00:32:56.339
If I'd have known you were a pro
I'd have tried to haggle you more.


00:32:56.341 --> 00:32:57.541
Fuck it.


00:32:58.243 --> 00:32:59.912
Why would you do that?


00:33:02.214 --> 00:33:06.783
I am tired of you paying for everything.


00:33:06.785 --> 00:33:08.952
You know you can't
control me like that any more.


00:33:08.954 --> 00:33:12.622
That's not the way it is!
Money doesn't mean anything to me.


00:33:12.624 --> 00:33:14.691
Of course! Easy for you to
say from where you're at.


00:33:14.693 --> 00:33:19.162
Sure. Because a drive to LA
sounds like so much fun!


00:33:19.164 --> 00:33:20.763
You said you wanted to see
the countryside with me.


00:33:20.765 --> 00:33:22.065
Yup, you, that's it.


00:33:22.067 --> 00:33:24.367
Had nothing to do with me not
wanting to shove that


00:33:24.369 --> 00:33:27.604
damn baggie up my ass to go
through airport security.


00:33:27.606 --> 00:33:30.140
Jamie, wake up!


00:33:30.142 --> 00:33:32.777
I had to break parole just to
even get here.


00:33:33.902 --> 00:33:34.778
What?!


00:33:35.479 --> 00:33:37.882
Why do you think I wanted
that woman buried too?


00:33:38.384 --> 00:33:41.952
Like I want cops sniffing around.
You know, gimme a break!


00:33:41.954 --> 00:33:44.421
You think all the problems
of the world just gonna


00:33:44.423 --> 00:33:46.890
go away because
you want them to?


00:33:46.892 --> 00:33:48.525
Why didn't you just tell me
the truth?


00:33:48.527 --> 00:33:50.760
You don't want the truth.


00:33:50.762 --> 00:33:52.261
I fell in love with you-


00:33:52.263 --> 00:33:54.030
No, you fell in love with saving me!


00:33:58.202 --> 00:34:00.371
Guess I failed at both of
those things.


00:34:00.973 --> 00:34:02.740
Yeah, well, I guess so too.


00:34:03.142 --> 00:34:04.608
You know what?


00:34:04.610 --> 00:34:06.510
I know you cheated on me!


00:34:07.212 --> 00:34:08.178
Oh fuck.


00:34:08.680 --> 00:34:09.646
What?


00:34:09.648 --> 00:34:12.483
I know what you did with Shelly.


00:34:13.485 --> 00:34:14.684
I don't know what you're
talking about.


00:34:14.686 --> 00:34:15.286
Don't!


00:34:25.731 --> 00:34:27.664
Jamie, it didn't mean anything.


00:34:27.666 --> 00:34:29.469
Don't you fucking dare!


00:34:32.271 --> 00:34:34.205
Men are pigs, Annie!


00:34:35.007 --> 00:34:36.541
Better you know that now.


00:34:37.743 --> 00:34:39.212
Oink, oink.


00:34:42.614 --> 00:34:45.882
Oh, come on. That's was
..that was pretty fucking funny.


00:34:45.884 --> 00:34:48.485
Look. I'm sorry, Jamie.


00:34:48.487 --> 00:34:51.323
If you got shit on doesn't mean
it's gonna happen to me.


00:34:53.725 --> 00:34:54.425
Really?


00:34:58.063 --> 00:34:59.764
You think this
one's any different?


00:35:00.766 --> 00:35:03.403
Look, you're not going there.


00:35:06.305 --> 00:35:08.005
Not on my wedding day.


00:35:16.081 --> 00:35:17.449
Come on...


00:35:19.151 --> 00:35:21.352
You can't judge
everybody like that.


00:35:22.154 --> 00:35:23.353
I'm not.


00:35:23.755 --> 00:35:27.357
If you listened, you'd know I'm
not talking about her.


00:35:27.559 --> 00:35:30.627
Who, Billy?
Come on, he's just all talk.


00:35:30.829 --> 00:35:32.797
I'm not talking about them!


00:35:33.499 --> 00:35:34.964
Ok, listen Jamie, I can expl...


00:35:34.966 --> 00:35:36.333
Don't touch me.


00:35:41.139 --> 00:35:46.576
I was so mad at you. I was so
mad at you I just wanted to


00:35:46.578 --> 00:35:49.314
hurt you like you hurt me.


00:35:51.116 --> 00:35:53.652
I hooked up with Billy last night.


00:35:55.354 --> 00:35:56.353
What?


00:35:56.555 --> 00:35:58.456
In the bathroom.


00:35:59.558 --> 00:36:01.993
You were probably off somewhere
selling your drugs.


00:36:03.195 --> 00:36:05.095
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
What the fuck!?


00:36:05.097 --> 00:36:06.766
At least he doesn't hide
who he is.


00:36:09.268 --> 00:36:11.135
Fine! You know what, go!


00:36:12.437 --> 00:36:14.171
Get back here and let's talk!


00:36:14.573 --> 00:36:15.553
Screw you!


00:36:23.882 --> 00:36:26.251
You know some people just
shouldn't be married.


00:36:27.653 --> 00:36:28.752
What do you mean?


00:36:28.754 --> 00:36:30.087
Think about it.


00:36:30.589 --> 00:36:35.294
You think Roy thought she'd turn
out to be such a nut job?


00:36:37.396 --> 00:36:38.829
Well, I'm not like that.


00:36:39.631 --> 00:36:42.836
Well, I dunno.
How can I be so sure?


00:36:46.238 --> 00:36:48.438
I'm as crazy as you want me to be.


00:37:01.587 --> 00:37:02.719
Oh...


00:37:02.721 --> 00:37:04.687
You are a bad girl.


00:37:05.790 --> 00:37:07.557
If that's what you want.


00:37:23.774 --> 00:37:25.542
Ooooh...


00:37:28.246 --> 00:37:30.448
Seems like someone's joined us.


00:37:31.550 --> 00:37:33.383
You're damn straight.


00:37:33.785 --> 00:37:36.022
I don't need a pill for that, Baby.


00:37:39.224 --> 00:37:41.291
And you never will when
you're with me.


00:38:05.483 --> 00:38:06.584
Billy!?


00:38:07.586 --> 00:38:08.987
He ain't here.


00:38:10.589 --> 00:38:11.522
Hello.


00:38:12.724 --> 00:38:14.157
What do you mean he isn't here?


00:38:14.359 --> 00:38:16.628
I mean what I say.
He ain't around.


00:38:18.330 --> 00:38:20.031
How long have you been there?


00:38:21.533 --> 00:38:22.604
Long enough.


00:38:27.706 --> 00:38:29.906
Easy, easy.
Don't be so damn jumpy.


00:38:29.908 --> 00:38:31.308
You just scared me.


00:38:31.410 --> 00:38:32.877
Not my intention.


00:38:34.579 --> 00:38:35.479
Billy!


00:38:41.987 --> 00:38:43.355
Where's Jamie?


00:38:45.857 --> 00:38:47.057
Screw her.


00:38:47.459 --> 00:38:49.526
Roy. Where's your wife?


00:38:50.461 --> 00:38:51.828
Gone.


00:38:56.834 --> 00:39:01.540
Gone, sayonara, vamoose.
And you what?


00:39:03.742 --> 00:39:05.509
It's all good with me.


00:39:13.551 --> 00:39:14.719
Billy!


00:39:15.921 --> 00:39:16.954
Billy!


00:39:17.456 --> 00:39:18.021
Bill...


00:39:18.023 --> 00:39:19.022
Jesus.


00:39:19.624 --> 00:39:20.557
What?


00:39:20.559 --> 00:39:21.559
Billy...


00:39:22.361 --> 00:39:23.526
I thought you left.


00:39:23.528 --> 00:39:26.963
Where the hell would I go?
I was taking a piss.


00:39:26.965 --> 00:39:28.398
Jamie's gone.


00:39:28.800 --> 00:39:29.999
What?


00:39:30.001 --> 00:39:31.736
He said she just took off.


00:39:32.838 --> 00:39:35.839
Whattaya mean? She just
can't 'take off' out here!


00:39:35.841 --> 00:39:38.842
Said she had enough and, she left.


00:39:39.344 --> 00:39:44.311
Left me, left you,
left this marriage.


00:39:46.550 --> 00:39:47.617
Good riddance.


00:39:47.619 --> 00:39:49.819
She can't be out there alone.


00:39:49.821 --> 00:39:51.856
You're worried about safe now?


00:39:52.758 --> 00:39:53.591
Or...


00:39:54.693 --> 00:39:57.230
maybe you want her back
for your own reasons.


00:40:00.506 --> 00:40:01.506
What is that supposed to mean?


00:40:01.532 --> 00:40:02.665
You know exactly what that means.


00:40:02.667 --> 00:40:05.672
No, Roy. I don't know
exactly what that means.


00:40:09.574 --> 00:40:11.074
We gotta go find her.


00:40:11.376 --> 00:40:13.009
If you think so, but...


00:40:13.011 --> 00:40:14.844
I think that we should split up.


00:40:14.846 --> 00:40:16.513
She couldn't have got far.


00:40:17.015 --> 00:40:18.515
Knock yourselves out.


00:40:18.517 --> 00:40:19.716
Just get your ass up!


00:40:19.718 --> 00:40:22.584
When the fuck did you find a
conscience?


00:40:25.689 --> 00:40:28.749
I don't remember you having one
when you killed that woman.


00:40:34.765 --> 00:40:39.069
Well, couple of bruises and
you turn into Mr. Sunshine, huh?


00:40:39.471 --> 00:40:42.638
Well that's me, baby.
Personality plus.


00:40:45.810 --> 00:40:48.446
She obviously hasn't come
by us, right. So...


00:40:49.648 --> 00:40:52.749
Why don't you head off there.
I'll head off over there.


00:40:52.751 --> 00:40:55.553
If you see her, if you see
anything, Just yell.


00:40:57.155 --> 00:40:59.558
Don't you think we should
just stay together?


00:41:02.160 --> 00:41:05.528
Baby, it's better if we
split up, all right.


00:41:05.530 --> 00:41:07.430
We don't know which way she went.


00:41:07.532 --> 00:41:09.666
Look, just go for ten minutes.


00:41:09.668 --> 00:41:11.268
If you can't find her then come back.


00:41:11.470 --> 00:41:13.369
All right, well just promise
that you're gonna stay close.


00:41:13.371 --> 00:41:15.874
Because I don't want to be
around him when he's like this.


00:41:17.776 --> 00:41:22.012
It's fine, Baby. He's just
pissed because Jamie dumped him.


00:41:22.414 --> 00:41:23.815
I can hear you.


00:41:25.417 --> 00:41:26.616
Ok, well good.


00:41:26.718 --> 00:41:29.552
Then maybe you'll stop creeping
out my fiance.


00:41:29.654 --> 00:41:32.056
Ooo, fiance.


00:41:33.458 --> 00:41:35.661
All right, Baby, go.
Just be careful.


00:41:38.163 --> 00:41:39.330
Fine.


00:41:47.738 --> 00:41:50.907
You know, you're a real
dickhead when you're high.


00:41:52.743 --> 00:41:56.111
Ah, blow me. Ha.


00:41:57.147 --> 00:41:58.815
Blow me.


00:42:04.755 --> 00:42:05.688
Jamie!


00:42:05.690 --> 00:42:06.657
Jamie!


00:42:12.796 --> 00:42:14.164
Jamie!


00:42:14.566 --> 00:42:16.968
Jamie!


00:42:18.470 --> 00:42:20.237
Jamie!


00:42:21.239 --> 00:42:23.140
BILLY!


00:42:23.742 --> 00:42:25.808
Billy! Come Quick!


00:42:30.881 --> 00:42:32.882
Annie, what!? What the fuck!?


00:42:32.884 --> 00:42:34.250
She's dead!


00:42:34.252 --> 00:42:35.018
What!?


00:42:35.020 --> 00:42:36.455
She's dead!


00:42:38.557 --> 00:42:40.156
Fuck. What happened?


00:42:40.158 --> 00:42:43.659
I just saw her lying here
and thought she just passed out.


00:42:43.661 --> 00:42:45.629
Then when I got closer
I saw all the blood.


00:42:46.631 --> 00:42:48.015
Jesus Christ!


00:42:56.741 --> 00:42:58.744
Jesus Christ!


00:43:01.746 --> 00:43:02.845
It's gonna be okay.


00:43:02.847 --> 00:43:03.880
Jamie?


00:43:03.982 --> 00:43:05.382
No, it won't.


00:43:05.684 --> 00:43:06.650
Jamie...


00:43:21.599 --> 00:43:23.267
I'm so sorry.


00:43:23.969 --> 00:43:25.470
Why'd you have to kill her?


00:43:27.672 --> 00:43:28.872
What?


00:43:30.040 --> 00:43:31.240
She's my wife?


00:43:31.242 --> 00:43:32.542
She was your wife.


00:43:32.544 --> 00:43:33.943
Shut the hell up!


00:43:33.945 --> 00:43:35.712
Annie, just leave it.


00:43:45.689 --> 00:43:47.991
Whoever killed that man
must've been back.


00:43:48.193 --> 00:43:49.959
Roy, I didn't see a car.


00:43:49.961 --> 00:43:51.696
That doesn't matter, Billy!


00:43:53.198 --> 00:43:55.601
She said that he used to hit her.


00:43:58.903 --> 00:43:59.936
That's bullshit.


00:43:59.938 --> 00:44:01.304
Then why would she say it?


00:44:01.306 --> 00:44:03.840
She was upset with me
because of something I did.


00:44:04.142 --> 00:44:07.622
That's why she slept with your
man last night!


00:44:08.779 --> 00:44:11.047
Whoa, whoa... No, no, no...


00:44:11.149 --> 00:44:13.282
Don't be dragging me into this shit.


00:44:13.284 --> 00:44:15.904
That didn't happen.
Billy was with me last night.


00:44:18.222 --> 00:44:21.224
She got you jealous so you
killed her.


00:44:21.926 --> 00:44:23.292
Why are you saying this?


00:44:23.294 --> 00:44:24.894
Whoa! Whoa!


00:44:25.296 --> 00:44:27.197
Roy. Both of you.


00:44:27.699 --> 00:44:29.568
Just calm the hell down.


00:44:32.170 --> 00:44:35.472
Listen...
I didn't kill my wife.


00:44:35.874 --> 00:44:39.208
At the very least,
she fell and hit her head.


00:44:39.210 --> 00:44:42.411
Look at her head, you fucking psycho!
It's bashed in!


00:44:42.413 --> 00:44:43.580
Hey you know what, just...


00:44:44.382 --> 00:44:45.848
We'll get the cops out here,


00:44:45.850 --> 00:44:47.652
and we'll let them figure it out.


00:44:49.054 --> 00:44:50.755
You think I did it too?


00:44:52.257 --> 00:44:55.192
That is for the cops to say.


00:44:55.994 --> 00:44:57.760
There's no cops out here, Billy!


00:44:57.762 --> 00:45:02.298
You need to chill the
fuck out, Roy.


00:45:02.300 --> 00:45:03.367
A gun?


00:45:04.169 --> 00:45:08.171
Let's call it my little
security blanket, ok?


00:45:08.373 --> 00:45:09.574
Whattaya gonna do?


00:45:11.076 --> 00:45:12.341
Shoot me now?


00:45:12.343 --> 00:45:16.015
I don't wanna shoot anyone.
Ok, but I will if I have to.


00:45:19.317 --> 00:45:21.619
I can't convince you two I'm
innocent...


00:45:23.021 --> 00:45:25.223
what hope do I have
with any cops.


00:45:26.725 --> 00:45:29.225
If you didn't do it, then
everything's fine.


00:45:29.227 --> 00:45:32.295
They have CSI guys that can
figure this shit out.


00:45:32.797 --> 00:45:36.897
Doesn't work that way when
you have a record like mine.


00:46:03.461 --> 00:46:04.845
I'm so sorry.


00:46:13.371 --> 00:46:14.604
I gotta go.


00:46:15.206 --> 00:46:16.739
You're leaving because
you're guilty.


00:46:16.741 --> 00:46:20.278
I'm leaving because I'm innocent.
Ok?


00:46:22.280 --> 00:46:24.981
We can't just let him go.
Do something.


00:46:24.983 --> 00:46:27.150
Roy, if you didn't do this


00:46:27.152 --> 00:46:30.854
then I think we should all just
stick together. Right?


00:46:31.156 --> 00:46:32.990
I'll take my chances.


00:46:33.792 --> 00:46:36.429
Roy, I'll fucking shoot you.


00:46:40.031 --> 00:46:41.868
I'm not stopping you.


00:46:45.270 --> 00:46:46.438
Roy!


00:46:49.040 --> 00:46:50.707
Fuck...


00:47:04.488 --> 00:47:07.124
Annie, I couldn't just
shoot him in the back.


00:47:08.526 --> 00:47:11.128
It's okay. It's okay.


00:47:12.230 --> 00:47:15.398
Probably better off that
he's gone anyway, right?


00:47:15.500 --> 00:47:17.734
I mean, what if he
didn't kill her?


00:47:17.836 --> 00:47:20.470
He answered that when he ran away.


00:47:20.872 --> 00:47:26.440
Shit. You know what,
I'm not... I'm not thinking straight.


00:47:26.810 --> 00:47:30.879
All the drugs and the booze.
You know, I'd have...


00:47:31.048 --> 00:47:33.482
I'd have fucking killed him if I
had to, though.


00:47:33.484 --> 00:47:35.251
It's okay. He's gone.


00:47:36.854 --> 00:47:41.492
You scared him off. Saved us.
You did.


00:47:43.294 --> 00:47:44.861
Yeah.


00:47:46.230 --> 00:47:47.933
We gotta move out.


00:47:51.035 --> 00:47:52.436
What about Jamie?


00:47:53.838 --> 00:47:56.305
What about her? What, do
you want to take her with us?


00:47:56.307 --> 00:47:58.207
We can't leave her here like this?


00:47:58.209 --> 00:47:59.809
Like what - dead?


00:47:59.911 --> 00:48:02.478
Sprawled out - food for
whatever lives out here.


00:48:02.480 --> 00:48:04.448
I don't think she's gonna
give a shit.


00:48:05.450 --> 00:48:08.418
We don't know how long it's gonna
be until we can get back here.


00:48:09.220 --> 00:48:11.558
It's just like that
woman at your car.


00:48:16.160 --> 00:48:17.527
All right, fine.


00:48:38.282 --> 00:48:40.651
Do you think we should go
back to the car?


00:48:42.553 --> 00:48:47.423
You know what? We never should've listened
to Roy in the first place and left the car.


00:48:47.625 --> 00:48:49.793
Probably all part of his plan.


00:48:50.495 --> 00:48:52.128
Makes sense.


00:48:52.530 --> 00:48:56.400
Yeah... Well he better not
come around here again.


00:48:57.502 --> 00:48:59.438
No more Mr. Nice guy.


00:49:02.440 --> 00:49:04.542
You hear that, Psycho!


00:49:06.444 --> 00:49:08.511
Come on. Let's go.


00:49:27.497 --> 00:49:29.565
Sorry, Jamie.


00:49:40.611 --> 00:49:42.745
- Hey. Hey.
- You wanna stop?


00:49:42.947 --> 00:49:43.913
I'm okay.


00:49:44.115 --> 00:49:47.283
Are you sure? I mean, we
can take a break if you want.


00:49:47.285 --> 00:49:48.451
No, I'll be all right.


00:49:48.653 --> 00:49:50.386
Just give me a second.


00:49:50.388 --> 00:49:52.589
Look! Water!


00:49:53.391 --> 00:49:54.857
It's probably a mirage.


00:49:54.859 --> 00:49:56.559
No, it might be water!


00:49:57.161 --> 00:50:00.864
Sure it is. Bet that's
where they bottle my Evian.


00:50:01.566 --> 00:50:02.982
Jesus. Fuck!


00:50:09.974 --> 00:50:13.644
Yeah, sure.
Thousand years ago, maybe.


00:50:14.946 --> 00:50:16.381
Shut up.


00:50:19.283 --> 00:50:20.650
I hate this place.


00:50:51.214 --> 00:50:51.948
Ohh...


00:50:52.550 --> 00:50:53.684
You okay?


00:50:55.586 --> 00:50:57.188
We gotta stop.


00:50:59.390 --> 00:51:01.023
We can't be too far now.


00:51:01.025 --> 00:51:04.392
Annie, it could be two feet.
We still gotta stop.


00:51:13.103 --> 00:51:14.670
You're still gonna protect me, right?


00:51:14.672 --> 00:51:18.008
Sweetie, from here on out
it is every man for himself.


00:51:19.610 --> 00:51:20.844
Ok...


00:51:21.446 --> 00:51:26.516
Wait. Look, none of this shit
would've happened to me before.


00:51:27.418 --> 00:51:30.518
I need to get back and
straighten everything out.


00:51:38.463 --> 00:51:39.663
What is it, Billy?


00:51:40.465 --> 00:51:41.531
Nothing.


00:51:42.633 --> 00:51:44.704
Nothing, let's
just keep moving.


00:51:48.506 --> 00:51:50.806
Jesus. Look at this place.


00:52:09.794 --> 00:52:12.228
Maybe we should check in
that little baggie again.


00:52:12.330 --> 00:52:13.796
There's no vicodin left.


00:52:13.798 --> 00:52:15.397
What about the percocets?


00:52:15.399 --> 00:52:16.599
That's gone too.


00:52:16.801 --> 00:52:19.468
You ate all the percocets?
Well, what's left in the bag?


00:52:19.470 --> 00:52:24.272
I dunno, Annie! Nothing that's going
to help us out here, I'm sure!


00:52:24.274 --> 00:52:28.113
Look, I'm sorry.
I was just trying to help.


00:52:31.315 --> 00:52:34.587
I know. I'm sorry.


00:52:38.089 --> 00:52:40.289
Look, how much do you
know about me?


00:52:40.591 --> 00:52:41.691
Whattaya mean?


00:52:42.393 --> 00:52:45.361
You obviously googled me
before the audition, right?


00:52:45.863 --> 00:52:48.231
Um, yeah.
A little bit, I guess.


00:52:48.833 --> 00:52:50.500
So, how much do you know?


00:52:51.602 --> 00:52:54.703
I know that you're a big success.


00:52:54.705 --> 00:52:55.504
And...


00:52:55.806 --> 00:52:58.508
You are hot as hell.


00:52:59.810 --> 00:53:01.715
So you know what
happened to me then?


00:53:06.517 --> 00:53:10.889
I've been sober five years,
four months, two days.


00:53:13.291 --> 00:53:15.627
There was a chick I used
to hang out with...


00:53:18.729 --> 00:53:20.598
No, she wasn't some chick.


00:53:22.200 --> 00:53:25.403
Her name was Angie
and I loved her. A lot.


00:53:27.705 --> 00:53:30.675
But she OD'd, on a bad batch.


00:53:32.677 --> 00:53:34.777
I woke up with a
plunger in my arm.


00:53:34.779 --> 00:53:39.750
I'd managed to plunge hers but I
passed out before I did my own.


00:53:41.552 --> 00:53:43.220
They said I killed her.


00:53:44.222 --> 00:53:48.302
Cops wanted to charge me, but,
my lawyers convinced the court that


00:53:49.726 --> 00:53:53.394
I was smart and rich enough
to clean up on my own.


00:53:58.602 --> 00:54:03.174
I've missed that woman everyday
since the day she died.


00:54:05.676 --> 00:54:09.412
But I've been sober since.
Just me against the world.


00:54:10.514 --> 00:54:11.914
Until last night.


00:54:18.823 --> 00:54:19.791
Well...


00:54:22.293 --> 00:54:23.760
you're not alone anymore.


00:54:27.497 --> 00:54:29.535
And we don't need these to
be happy.


00:54:32.937 --> 00:54:34.637
My little muse, huh?


00:54:43.214 --> 00:54:47.451
Listen, I been thinking, Billy.
And after what you just told me...


00:54:48.753 --> 00:54:52.121
You know there was only one person who
was against us burying that woman.


00:54:52.623 --> 00:54:54.625
And burying all the trouble that
went with her.


00:54:56.827 --> 00:54:58.061
With Jamie...


00:54:59.263 --> 00:55:00.029
gone...


00:55:00.531 --> 00:55:02.198
and if Roy runs...


00:55:02.600 --> 00:55:05.535
We're the ones to deal with the
rap on hitting that woman?


00:55:06.237 --> 00:55:08.304
I mean she ran into our road.


00:55:08.306 --> 00:55:09.806
She shot at us.


00:55:10.808 --> 00:55:13.410
She probably even killed that
man back there.


00:55:14.412 --> 00:55:16.180
That's what I've been
saying all along.


00:55:17.982 --> 00:55:23.182
So you agree that we should
just make it all go away.


00:55:27.692 --> 00:55:29.059
I totally agree.


00:55:30.861 --> 00:55:32.428
Come on. Let's go.


00:56:29.686 --> 00:56:32.221
Oh... Wait... Billy?


00:56:32.323 --> 00:56:34.622
Billy! That's the car!
There's the car!


00:56:34.624 --> 00:56:37.459
We found it! Hahaha!


00:56:37.561 --> 00:56:39.295
I knew I'd find it!


00:56:39.897 --> 00:56:41.397
I never doubted you.


00:56:42.099 --> 00:56:43.100
I...


00:56:44.702 --> 00:56:46.469
AM THE GOLDEN CHILD!!


00:56:47.471 --> 00:56:49.772
Well. At least I don't see Roy.


00:56:50.074 --> 00:56:51.840
Come on. Let's go.
It's shelter.


00:56:51.842 --> 00:56:53.075
Come on.


00:56:53.677 --> 00:56:55.344
Someone kill me.


00:57:05.488 --> 00:57:08.491
I am never walking anywhere
ever again.


00:57:09.393 --> 00:57:10.793
Sounds good to me.


00:57:11.595 --> 00:57:12.928
WHOOOO!


00:57:12.930 --> 00:57:14.463
Careful. That might be hot.


00:57:14.665 --> 00:57:15.932
Fuck.


00:57:23.573 --> 00:57:25.608
Think anybody came past
while we were gone?


00:57:26.710 --> 00:57:28.577
I dunno. You see any tracks?


00:57:35.852 --> 00:57:36.585
No.


00:57:36.787 --> 00:57:38.455
Well then, there's your answer.


00:57:40.157 --> 00:57:42.024
Where do you think Roy is?


00:57:42.526 --> 00:57:43.926
Dead I hope.


00:57:44.728 --> 00:57:45.928
What if he comes back?


00:57:45.930 --> 00:57:47.329
Then I'll shoot him.


00:57:47.531 --> 00:57:48.497
You will?


00:57:48.999 --> 00:57:51.866
Fuck him.
We were here first.


00:57:59.476 --> 00:58:00.943
Eventually it's gonna be dark.


00:58:00.945 --> 00:58:03.779
Which means cars will have
to turn on their headlights.


00:58:04.181 --> 00:58:06.181
We won't be able to see
them from here.


00:58:06.183 --> 00:58:09.855
No, not from here. From there.


00:58:12.957 --> 00:58:14.757
We're getting out of here, Baby.


00:58:15.059 --> 00:58:17.760
But first we gotta deal with
that chick in the trunk.


00:58:18.462 --> 00:58:19.862
Let's start digging.


00:58:31.475 --> 00:58:32.609
Ohhh.


00:58:34.111 --> 00:58:35.078
Fuck.


00:59:02.238 --> 00:59:03.374
Yeah.


00:59:05.676 --> 00:59:06.876
This should work.


00:59:07.778 --> 00:59:11.013
You're damn straight. Huh?
Who's the man?


00:59:11.015 --> 00:59:12.317
You are.


00:59:15.019 --> 00:59:16.853
Damn right, Baby.


00:59:17.955 --> 00:59:21.725
'Cause I am Billy fucking Rich!


00:59:23.127 --> 00:59:24.227
Whooo!


00:59:33.170 --> 00:59:36.072
Wow. Ok.


00:59:36.674 --> 00:59:38.774
Vegas, here we come!


00:59:44.815 --> 00:59:46.016
Oh yeah...


00:59:47.618 --> 00:59:50.288
There's gonna be some
cars coming now, baby.


00:59:53.190 --> 00:59:55.290
There's gonna be some
cars coming now.


01:00:03.867 --> 01:00:06.769
It's not like we're in the
fucking outback?


01:00:07.071 --> 01:00:08.838
Where the hell is every one?


01:00:09.540 --> 01:00:10.942
Someone'll find us.


01:00:13.844 --> 01:00:15.177
Are you hungry?


01:00:15.879 --> 01:00:17.246
Starving.


01:00:17.748 --> 01:00:19.816
Why haven't you said anything
about it?


01:00:21.118 --> 01:00:22.821
I don't like complaining.


01:00:26.123 --> 01:00:28.362
Are you sure you're an actress?


01:00:33.564 --> 01:00:34.564
What was that?


01:00:35.766 --> 01:00:36.767
What?


01:00:38.569 --> 01:00:40.102
You didn't hear that?


01:00:40.904 --> 01:00:42.771
There's no nobody out here.


01:00:53.216 --> 01:00:56.218
Oh shit! Get up. Get up!


01:00:56.220 --> 01:00:57.956
It's Roy. Get up!


01:01:01.058 --> 01:01:02.626
What are you doing here?


01:01:04.728 --> 01:01:06.997
Roy, you don't look so good.


01:01:08.999 --> 01:01:10.266
You gotta help me.


01:01:11.168 --> 01:01:16.071
Why don't you let me see your
hands and I'll think about it.


01:01:16.373 --> 01:01:17.939
I didn't kill my wife.


01:01:17.941 --> 01:01:20.142
Yeah, so you said.


01:01:20.944 --> 01:01:22.311
I loved her.


01:01:22.713 --> 01:01:24.550
You weren't acting like it.


01:01:28.352 --> 01:01:29.751
Why don't you sit down?


01:01:29.753 --> 01:01:31.254
She saved me.


01:01:32.356 --> 01:01:34.189
Saved me from myself.


01:01:34.191 --> 01:01:35.557
He said stop.


01:01:35.959 --> 01:01:37.526
You gotta believe me.


01:01:38.028 --> 01:01:40.496
Don't make me fucking shoot you.


01:01:40.798 --> 01:01:42.164
She was my life.


01:01:42.166 --> 01:01:44.001
Don't make me shoot you, Roy.


01:01:46.203 --> 01:01:49.038
Annie. Annie.


01:01:50.140 --> 01:01:51.440
Annie.


01:01:52.242 --> 01:01:55.180
I was there when you woke up.
Remember?


01:01:58.682 --> 01:01:59.781
Where were you?


01:01:59.783 --> 01:02:01.049
The fuck you talking about?


01:02:01.051 --> 01:02:04.520
You had to shut her up,
didn't you?


01:02:05.122 --> 01:02:09.489
He tell you what he
did to my wife last night?


01:02:14.263 --> 01:02:15.297
Billy?


01:02:15.899 --> 01:02:18.904
This is all your fault.


01:02:22.306 --> 01:02:24.039
Billy. Say something.


01:02:24.041 --> 01:02:26.809
Yeah, Billy. Say something.


01:02:27.111 --> 01:02:29.345
It's not the way he's
putting it, Annie.


01:02:30.247 --> 01:02:31.917
She kissed me!


01:02:35.719 --> 01:02:37.754
Look. We didn't...


01:02:38.756 --> 01:02:40.322
The fuck... it... this...


01:02:40.724 --> 01:02:42.157
it doesn't fucking matter anyways.


01:02:42.159 --> 01:02:44.192
You killed her. I didn't.


01:02:44.194 --> 01:02:45.928
She was gonna tell you, Annie


01:02:46.230 --> 01:02:49.667
but he killed her so
you could never find out.


01:02:52.169 --> 01:02:54.236
Billy, where were you when
I was sleeping?


01:02:54.938 --> 01:02:58.273
I was taking a piss. You know that.
I didn't even see her.


01:02:58.275 --> 01:03:00.544
You got as many
witnesses as me.


01:03:02.746 --> 01:03:03.984
I got the truth.


01:03:08.886 --> 01:03:09.951
The truth?


01:03:10.053 --> 01:03:14.055
Hahaha...


01:03:14.057 --> 01:03:18.225
Is that why you
two buried that woman? Huh?


01:03:18.828 --> 01:03:19.996
The truth?


01:03:22.932 --> 01:03:23.999
Oh yeah.


01:03:25.968 --> 01:03:28.236
I know more than you think.


01:03:32.308 --> 01:03:34.176
But I got a gun.


01:03:34.178 --> 01:03:37.414
So why don't you shut the fuck
up and sit down.


01:03:39.016 --> 01:03:40.584
You know what Billy?


01:03:42.486 --> 01:03:44.521
You ain't got the balls.


01:03:46.223 --> 01:03:48.227
Why don't you try me, Roy?


01:03:51.929 --> 01:03:53.562
Stop! Billy!


01:03:53.864 --> 01:03:54.831
Stop!


01:03:56.033 --> 01:03:57.699
Shoot... Billy!


01:03:57.901 --> 01:03:59.302
BILLY!


01:04:01.004 --> 01:04:02.437
Roy! Stop!


01:04:07.511 --> 01:04:09.111
Ughhh...


01:04:10.113 --> 01:04:11.248
Shit...


01:04:12.850 --> 01:04:13.883
Oh... Ughhh...


01:04:18.421 --> 01:04:20.089
Oh fuck...


01:04:21.191 --> 01:04:22.271
Oh fuck...


01:04:27.097 --> 01:04:28.097
Fuck!


01:04:29.199 --> 01:04:31.366
He went fucking crazy!


01:04:31.468 --> 01:04:34.469
You needed to. You needed to.
You had to.


01:04:34.471 --> 01:04:36.438
He was fucking crazy!


01:04:36.940 --> 01:04:40.944
You had to. To save me.
You did.


01:04:42.246 --> 01:04:45.180
I never killed Jamie.
I never killed anyone... ever.


01:04:45.182 --> 01:04:47.885
Listen to me. I believe you.
Ok? I believe you.


01:04:49.887 --> 01:04:51.586
What he said about last
night, Annie...


01:04:51.588 --> 01:04:52.721
Ssssh.


01:04:53.323 --> 01:04:56.524
It doesn't matter, ok? We all
have a past. I told you that.


01:04:56.526 --> 01:04:58.927
And that's what this is.
This is the past.


01:04:59.129 --> 01:05:00.962
Whatever he said...
look at me...


01:05:01.064 --> 01:05:02.464
it doesn't matter.


01:05:02.966 --> 01:05:06.803
'Cause as long as we're together,
we're gonna be fine.


01:05:07.905 --> 01:05:13.174
We're gonna be fine. Ok?
Ok.


01:05:13.176 --> 01:05:14.544
Look at me. Look at me.


01:05:16.446 --> 01:05:17.813
We're gonna be fine.


01:05:34.163 --> 01:05:36.800
You know, this actually
might work out.


01:05:38.902 --> 01:05:40.937
We know that Roy killed Jamie.


01:05:42.239 --> 01:05:44.407
And we can say that
he was driving too.


01:05:46.009 --> 01:05:48.210
That he went crazy and
attacked us.


01:05:48.612 --> 01:05:52.148
That way we won't have to hide
any more dead bodies out here.


01:05:53.050 --> 01:05:55.352
Billy, what if Roy didn't
kill Jamie?


01:05:57.154 --> 01:05:59.756
What if whoever killed that guy
in the suit came back and did it?


01:06:01.658 --> 01:06:03.526
What if he's watching us now?


01:06:04.528 --> 01:06:06.695
No. There's nobody else out here.


01:06:06.997 --> 01:06:08.965
Baby, it's okay. You're safe.


01:06:10.067 --> 01:06:12.268
Then what if Jamie really did fall?


01:06:13.570 --> 01:06:14.702
You said Roy...


01:06:14.704 --> 01:06:16.405
I said I think Roy did it.


01:06:17.107 --> 01:06:18.941
But you know how the cops are.


01:06:20.143 --> 01:06:22.143
If they prove it was a accident,
we don't want them to be


01:06:22.145 --> 01:06:24.079
suspicious about you shooting Roy.


01:06:24.181 --> 01:06:26.047
And what happens if
they find that woman?


01:06:26.149 --> 01:06:27.649
Roy attacked me.


01:06:27.651 --> 01:06:30.352
And that's exactly what
we'll tell them - if we have to.


01:06:33.456 --> 01:06:34.823
But think about it.


01:06:37.493 --> 01:06:40.028
They're just a couple of
tourists we met last night.


01:06:40.030 --> 01:06:41.597
Who knows what happened
after that?


01:06:43.933 --> 01:06:45.801
Maybe we came out
here on our own.


01:06:47.436 --> 01:06:49.004
I don't know, Annie.


01:06:49.606 --> 01:06:53.246
I don't think that we should push
our luck farther than we gotta.


01:06:55.077 --> 01:06:55.577
Yeah.


01:06:59.549 --> 01:07:03.085
I just can't bear the thought of seeing
you in prison, Billy. It'd kill me.


01:07:03.987 --> 01:07:04.853
What?


01:07:05.155 --> 01:07:07.355
I would do anything for
you to stop that.


01:07:09.358 --> 01:07:10.626
Even this.


01:07:13.029 --> 01:07:14.296
And the way I see it...


01:07:15.664 --> 01:07:17.933
there are tons of dead
bodies out here anyway.


01:07:19.068 --> 01:07:20.436
What's one more?


01:07:27.343 --> 01:07:28.910
Aw, fuck.


01:07:38.354 --> 01:07:40.056
This is the right thing to do.


01:07:41.258 --> 01:07:43.826
I don't want anybody
questioning you about murder.


01:07:44.528 --> 01:07:45.427
Murder?


01:07:45.529 --> 01:07:46.928
Don't even think about it.


01:07:46.930 --> 01:07:48.432
It won't come to that.


01:07:50.534 --> 01:07:52.066
We have too big a future
ahead of us


01:07:52.068 --> 01:07:53.468
to let this get in the way.


01:07:53.570 --> 01:07:54.970
Future?


01:07:55.472 --> 01:07:57.272
I am fucked, Annie.


01:07:57.474 --> 01:07:58.675
I'm done.


01:08:00.577 --> 01:08:02.977
You're not done.
You're the golden boy.


01:08:11.421 --> 01:08:13.490
The studio fired me yesterday.


01:08:15.192 --> 01:08:19.997
That retread of a bitch Lyla had me
replaced with her douchebag boyfriend.


01:08:22.699 --> 01:08:24.367
But it was your show.


01:08:25.469 --> 01:08:27.704
It's always the studio's show.


01:08:29.206 --> 01:08:30.373
What happened?


01:08:31.775 --> 01:08:35.511
A year ago she was back
hostessing at the SaddleRanch.


01:08:36.313 --> 01:08:38.780
Now she has a record deal,
a perfume brand,


01:08:38.882 --> 01:08:43.286
and she's probably flogging a line of
goddamn tampons at Target...


01:08:45.388 --> 01:08:46.554
Now my show.


01:08:46.556 --> 01:08:47.889
Bye bye, baby.


01:08:48.091 --> 01:08:49.624
But her boyfriend?


01:08:49.826 --> 01:08:52.326
It's the Hollywood way, Baby.


01:08:59.536 --> 01:09:00.936
You'll get another one.


01:09:01.838 --> 01:09:02.838
Annie...


01:09:03.640 --> 01:09:04.906
I'm forty.


01:09:06.675 --> 01:09:09.755
That's like a hundred in
Hollywood years, ok.


01:09:10.246 --> 01:09:12.914
If I don't have the mojo to
overrule that bitch...


01:09:16.952 --> 01:09:18.320
Then I got nothing.


01:09:26.762 --> 01:09:28.030
But you know what?


01:09:34.103 --> 01:09:35.971
We don't need that shit town.


01:09:37.607 --> 01:09:40.842
What?
It's a hole. It's a cesspool.


01:09:41.344 --> 01:09:44.646
It'll eat up sweet, innocent
girls like you.


01:09:44.648 --> 01:09:46.182
Look what it did to me?


01:09:47.584 --> 01:09:48.950
We can leave.


01:09:49.252 --> 01:09:50.819
We'll go somewhere free.


01:09:51.621 --> 01:09:55.290
We'll take a chance.
The whole world is open to us.


01:09:55.892 --> 01:09:56.793
Listen.


01:09:58.195 --> 01:10:00.496
I want to give you that white
picket fence,


01:10:01.598 --> 01:10:03.298
and those 2.5 children,


01:10:03.300 --> 01:10:05.266
and those puppies,
and those fireworks,


01:10:05.268 --> 01:10:07.135
and all that apple pie crap.


01:10:07.837 --> 01:10:09.305
You said it yourself.


01:10:10.207 --> 01:10:11.406
We're a team.


01:10:11.708 --> 01:10:15.512
As long as we stick together,
nothing can stop us.


01:10:17.214 --> 01:10:18.380
Yeah...


01:10:18.682 --> 01:10:19.482
Sure.


01:10:25.589 --> 01:10:27.089
Now come on.


01:10:27.891 --> 01:10:30.496
Let's get off
this god damn mountain.


01:10:34.798 --> 01:10:36.264
Annie, come on.


01:10:49.678 --> 01:10:50.812
You know what, baby?


01:10:50.914 --> 01:10:52.313
We'll go to Canada.


01:10:52.515 --> 01:10:54.716
I shot a movie there in '99.


01:10:54.818 --> 01:10:57.218
Those people don't even lock
their doors.


01:10:57.520 --> 01:10:58.853
Don't they live in igloos?


01:10:58.855 --> 01:11:00.622
HaHa. Igloos.


01:11:04.193 --> 01:11:05.461
Shit, baby. Headlights!


01:11:07.730 --> 01:11:09.397
I knew they'd come!


01:11:13.535 --> 01:11:15.103
You know what, you're right.


01:11:16.238 --> 01:11:19.543
You're right, we don't need the
press from this.


01:11:22.345 --> 01:11:23.779
We need to hide the evidence.


01:11:24.381 --> 01:11:25.148
Annie?


01:11:26.750 --> 01:11:27.550
Annie?


01:11:29.552 --> 01:11:31.487
Let's go back to the start.


01:11:32.389 --> 01:11:33.725
How did you meet Billy Rich?


01:11:37.627 --> 01:11:38.727
At the wrap party.


01:11:40.530 --> 01:11:42.597
I didn't even know who
Billy Rich was.


01:11:43.332 --> 01:11:46.293
And he certainly wasn't the type of
person I planned on being around.


01:11:55.678 --> 01:11:58.780
I wanted to leave.
It just wasn't my scene.


01:11:58.982 --> 01:12:00.348
But you didn't.


01:12:02.318 --> 01:12:03.085
No.


01:12:05.921 --> 01:12:07.055
I didn't.


01:12:07.557 --> 01:12:10.524
Billy called me over,
bought me a drink.


01:12:12.294 --> 01:12:15.262
I auditioned for you...
for this show.


01:12:16.298 --> 01:12:18.299
I audition a lot of girls.


01:12:18.601 --> 01:12:19.668
Not like me.


01:12:20.870 --> 01:12:22.937
Well that remains to be seen.


01:12:24.440 --> 01:12:26.560
Wasn't long before I
learned he was Billy Rich.


01:12:27.443 --> 01:12:29.310
Hollywood's prodigal son.


01:12:31.747 --> 01:12:35.349
I mean what harm could come from
letting him buy me a few drinks?


01:12:36.051 --> 01:12:39.619
We drank, talked, laughed.


01:12:42.358 --> 01:12:45.559
It was like I was inside a world I'd
always looked at from the outside.


01:12:50.366 --> 01:12:52.133
It was all so innocent.


01:13:05.647 --> 01:13:07.715
Billy said I was the muse
he always wanted.


01:13:12.855 --> 01:13:15.923
I know I was just wrapped up in
the moment but it was so sweet.


01:13:17.426 --> 01:13:19.094
Like I always imagined.


01:13:20.896 --> 01:13:22.563
I felt like a princess.


01:13:29.772 --> 01:13:31.339
And then it all went to hell.


01:13:34.042 --> 01:13:36.810
That crash. She was dead.


01:13:39.581 --> 01:13:42.901
It was so hot, none of us could
think straight.


01:13:46.855 --> 01:13:48.123
It was horrible.


01:13:49.725 --> 01:13:53.406
Then Billy brought out all this
champagne... and pills.


01:13:55.432 --> 01:13:58.566
But the pain from the accident
was so bad.


01:13:58.868 --> 01:14:00.535
How stupid could I be?


01:14:09.578 --> 01:14:10.645
Are you okay?


01:14:15.083 --> 01:14:16.218
It's nothing.


01:14:16.820 --> 01:14:18.120
Tell me what happened.


01:14:19.122 --> 01:14:20.489
Start with Roy.


01:14:26.728 --> 01:14:28.896
I tried to keep everyone as
calm as I could.


01:14:29.031 --> 01:14:30.565
Just shoot him!


01:14:30.667 --> 01:14:33.401
I pleaded for him to stop.


01:14:33.603 --> 01:14:36.770
If only I had been stronger I could have
stopped it before anyone else got hurt.


01:14:36.838 --> 01:14:37.606
KILL HIM!


01:14:44.179 --> 01:14:45.482
It was horrible.


01:14:47.884 --> 01:14:49.285
Billy shot Roy.


01:14:50.687 --> 01:14:52.390
Shot him right in the chest.


01:14:55.492 --> 01:14:57.327
There was just so much blood.


01:14:59.529 --> 01:15:00.729
And Jamie?


01:15:01.431 --> 01:15:03.332
When things got crazy,
she took off.


01:15:04.734 --> 01:15:05.534
Jamie!


01:15:08.738 --> 01:15:10.738
She was already a mess when
I found her.


01:15:18.047 --> 01:15:20.351
I could have had anybody I wanted.


01:15:23.953 --> 01:15:26.353
And I ended up with Roy.


01:15:32.896 --> 01:15:37.132
Prison broke him,
I know that now.


01:15:38.034 --> 01:15:40.201
Something you might want to think
about if they press charges


01:15:40.203 --> 01:15:42.204
against Billy for killing
that woman.


01:15:43.206 --> 01:15:44.607
What do you mean?


01:15:46.809 --> 01:15:48.377
We can't hide what happened.


01:15:49.779 --> 01:15:51.078
Billy shouldn't have been driving.


01:15:51.080 --> 01:15:52.480
It was an accident.


01:15:52.782 --> 01:15:54.783
Then I guess the authorities
will figure that out.


01:15:55.485 --> 01:15:57.587
I'm not gonna hide the truth, though.


01:15:59.889 --> 01:16:02.223
Billy was driving
and Billy hit her.


01:16:02.225 --> 01:16:04.995
He doesn't seem to show a lot of
remorse about that either.


01:16:07.797 --> 01:16:10.101
Are you sure you know who you're
getting involved with?


01:16:14.003 --> 01:16:15.606
I really wish I had.


01:16:19.108 --> 01:16:21.075
Shut the fuck up, bitch!


01:16:26.915 --> 01:16:28.383
Annie...


01:16:28.985 --> 01:16:30.186
Annie...


01:16:32.188 --> 01:16:34.558
You're not doing this to me.


01:16:37.060 --> 01:16:38.793
I heard her scream...


01:16:38.795 --> 01:16:40.197
and came running.


01:16:42.599 --> 01:16:44.166
My God, it was horrible.


01:16:45.568 --> 01:16:48.236
Billy was rambling about how she
was gonna tell.


01:16:48.838 --> 01:16:51.841
How she wouldn't hide the drunk
driving, hitting that woman.


01:16:53.743 --> 01:16:56.580
He held her face in
the dirt as she kicked.


01:16:59.282 --> 01:17:00.550
Dying.


01:17:03.152 --> 01:17:05.487
The look in Billy's eyes when he
saw me.


01:17:06.889 --> 01:17:12.389
He was cold, emotionless,
like an animal.


01:17:17.934 --> 01:17:19.705
He was against everyone now.


01:17:24.607 --> 01:17:25.773
Billy!


01:17:26.275 --> 01:17:27.709
Then Roy showed up.


01:17:28.311 --> 01:17:30.478
He rushed at Billy...
but Billy had a gun.


01:17:31.280 --> 01:17:33.482
Poor Roy.
There was nothing he could do.


01:17:35.284 --> 01:17:38.219
He herded Roy and me back
towards the car at gun point.


01:17:38.921 --> 01:17:41.157
Rambling. Threatening.


01:17:43.059 --> 01:17:44.760
Roy just couldn't take it anymore.


01:17:46.062 --> 01:17:49.034
The idea of that bastard
killing his wife?


01:17:53.036 --> 01:17:54.571
Roy went after Billy.


01:17:56.773 --> 01:17:58.210
And died for it.


01:18:03.012 --> 01:18:04.312
Bottom line?


01:18:04.714 --> 01:18:06.449
You're lucky to be alive.


01:18:08.651 --> 01:18:10.151
We need to hide the evidence.


01:18:10.153 --> 01:18:11.852
Here. Get rid of that.


01:18:11.954 --> 01:18:13.187
He was slapping me.


01:18:13.189 --> 01:18:15.556
Hitting me so hard I thought I'd
black out.


01:18:15.958 --> 01:18:17.392
He wouldn't stop.


01:18:18.194 --> 01:18:19.928
I knew what was next.


01:18:21.230 --> 01:18:23.030
He gave me no choice.


01:18:29.806 --> 01:18:31.038
Annie, what are you doing?


01:18:31.040 --> 01:18:32.641
You lied to me.


01:18:34.243 --> 01:18:35.776
What are you talking about?


01:18:35.878 --> 01:18:37.679
You said you'd make me a star.


01:18:38.281 --> 01:18:40.247
